   "source": [
    "#  NASA Li-ion Battery Aging Dataset\n",
    "## Deep Learning Based Capacity and SOH Prediction\n",
    "\n",
    "### Models:\n",
    "- LSTM\n",
    "- GRU\n",
    "- CNN + LSTM\n",
    "\n",
    "### Prediction Targets:\n",
    "1. Capacity\n",
    "2. State of Health (SOH)\n",
    "\n",
    "### Author:\n",
    "Shrijan Samrat\n",
    "\n",
    "### Internship:\n",
    "AI/ML Summer Internship 2026 NIT-C"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "23b3e459-79f7-445c-b72f-7048bacd0997",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Step 1: Import Required Libraries\n",
    "\n",
    "In this section, we import all the libraries required for:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Numerical computations\n",
    "- Data manipulation\n",
    "- Visualization\n",
    "- Reading MATLAB (.mat) files\n",
    "- Data preprocessing\n",
    "- Deep Learning model building\n",
    "- Model evaluation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "d915b3e0-5480-4046-bc10-eac4d37f4603",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ================================\n",
    "# Numerical Computation\n",
    "# ================================\n",
    "\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "# ================================\n",
    "# Data Manipulation\n",
    "# ================================\n",
    "\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "\n",
    "# ================================\n",
    "# Visualization\n",
    "# ================================\n",
    "\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "# ================================\n",
    "# Read MATLAB Files\n",
    "# ================================\n",
    "\n",
    "from scipy.io import loadmat\n",
    "\n",
    "# ================================\n",
    "# Scikit-learn Utilities\n",
    "# ================================\n",
    "\n",
    "from sklearn.preprocessing import MinMaxScaler\n",
    "\n",
    "from sklearn.metrics import (\n",
    "    mean_absolute_error,\n",
    "    mean_squared_error,\n",
    "    r2_score\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# ================================\n",
    "# TensorFlow / Keras\n",
    "# ================================\n",
    "\n",
    "import tensorflow as tf\n",
    "\n",
    "from tensorflow.keras.models import Sequential\n",
    "\n",
    "from tensorflow.keras.layers import (\n",
    "    Dense,\n",
    "    Dropout,\n",
    "    LSTM,\n",
    "    GRU,\n",
    "    Conv1D,\n",
    "    MaxPooling1D,\n",
    "    Flatten\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "# ================================\n",
    "# Ignore Warnings\n",
    "# ================================\n",
    "\n",
    "import warnings\n",
    "\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings(\"ignore\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c67c4d75-6ffc-4512-964f-1a971428860b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Step 2: Load the NASA Battery Dataset\n",
    "\n",
